  "title": "New Integration: 2N Intercoms",
  "summary": "Today we are announcing the release of our 2N intercom integration. This now lets you connect 2N intercoms and access systems to Seam and use our API + dashboard to control them. You can unlock doors, edit resident directory, and retrieve entry events. Most 2N intercom models come with a built in camera which we will release as part of our broader Universal Camera API later this summer.",
